{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52327","headline":"诗（幷序） 八十八 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 八十八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"难[忍]傥能忍，能忍最爲难。\n伏肉虎不食，病鸟人不弹。\n当时虽{各寺}（张改作「碕」）堵，过後必身安。\n唾面不须拭，从风自荫乾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52327.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52327","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}